# The extracted art. Generated by tools/extract-media.mjs from
# build/the-raven.html, which IS committed and already carries all 139
# images as base64 data URIs. Tracking the extracted copies too would
# store the same pixels twice in one repository, the first copy a third
# larger for being base64. Nothing is at risk: the source of truth is the
# build, the tool is idempotent, and `node tools/extract-media.mjs`
# rebuilds the folder byte for byte.
pack/art/
